        "title": "Behavioral Finance Kya Hai — Introduction",
        "content": "Bhai, Module 1 mein humne dekha tha ki paisa kya hai aur kaise kaam karta hai. But wait — kya tumne socha hai ki jab tumhe pata hai ki saving karni chahiye, tab bhi tum shopping kyun karte ho? Jab jaante ho ki credit card dangerous hai, tab bhi use kyun karte ho? Yahi hai **Behavioral Finance** ka magic!\n\n### Traditional Finance vs Behavioral Finance\n\n| Feature | Traditional Finance | Behavioral Finance |\n|---------|-------------------|-------------------|\n| Assumption | Humans are rational | Humans are emotional + rational |\n| Decision making | Logic se hota hai | Feelings bhi affect karti hain |\n| Market behavior | Perfect information hoti hai | Information incomplete hoti hai |\n| Goal | Maximum profit | Understand kyun galti karte ho |\n| Example | \"Calculate karo ROI\" | \"Kyun nahi kar pa rahe ho ROI calculate?\" |\n\n### Smart Log Dumb Money Decisions Kyun Karte Hain?\n\nDekho, hamara dimag do systems se kaam karta hai:",
