        "title": "Money Personality Types — Tumhara Paisa Kaunsa Hai?",
        "content": "Yaar, har insaan ka paisa se rishta alag hota hai. Koi bahut bachata hai, koi bahut kharch karta hai, koi invest karna nahi jaanta, koi paisa se darta hai. Chalo, pehle ek quick quiz karte hain!\n\n### Money Personality Quiz (20 Questions)\n\n**Instructions:** Har question ke liye 1-5 mein score do (1 = bilkul nahi, 5 = bahut zyada)\n\n**Questions:**\n\n| Q# | Question | Score (1-5) |\n|----|----------|-------------|\n| 1 | Jab mere account mein paisa aata hai, main sabse pehle save karta/karti hoon | ___ |\n| 2 | Mujhe shopping karna bahut pasand hai, especially clothes aur gadgets | ___ |\n| 3 | Main stocks, mutual funds ke baare mein padhta/padhti hoon | ___ |\n| 4 | Main apne friends/family ke liye kharch karna khushi deta hai | ___ |\n| 5 | Main paise ke baare mein sochna avoid karta/karti hoon | ___ |\n| 6 | Mere paas ek proper budget hai | ___ |\n| 7 | Main impulse buying kabhi nahi karta/karti | ___ |\n| 8 | Main investment opportunities dhundhta/dhundhti hoon | ___ |\n| 9 | Main charity ya donations mein contribute karta/karti hoon | ___ |\n| 10 | Main bank balance dekhne se darta/darti hoon | ___ |\n| 11 | Main sale mein extra cheezein khareed leta/leti hoon | ___ |\n| 12 | Main apne goals ke liye regular save karta/karti hoon | ___ |\n| 13 | Main financial books/podcasts consume karta/karti hoon | ___ |\n| 14 | Main kisi ki madad ke liye apna paisa de sakta/sakti hoon | ___ |\n| 15 | Main paise ki tension leta/leti hoon | ___ |\n| 16 | Main budget banata/banati hoon aur follow bhi karta/karti hoon | ___ |\n| 17 | Mujhe branded cheezein pasand hain | ___ |\n| 18 | Main financial planning seriously leta/leti hoon | ___ |\n| 19 | Main apne friends ko financial advice deta/deti hoon | ___ |\n| 20 | Main financial decisions lene se dar'ta/dar'ti hoon | ___ |\n\n### Scoring Pattern:\n\n| Question Group | Questions | Personality Type |\n|---------------|-----------|-----------------|\n| Q1 + Q6 + Q12 + Q16 | Saver Score | The Saver |\n| Q2 + Q7 + Q11 + Q17 | Spender Score | The Spender |\n| Q3 + Q8 + Q13 + Q18 | Investor Score | The Investor |\n| Q4 + Q9 + Q14 + Q19 | Giver Score | The Giver |\n| Q5 + Q10 + Q15 + Q20 | Avoider Score | The Avoider |\n\n### The 5 Money Personality Types — Detailed Breakdown\n\n#### 1. THE SAVER (Bachhoo Ke Baap Type)\n\n**Score Range:** 16-20 points in Saver category\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Strengths** | Financially disciplined, emergency fund ready, debt-free |\n| **Weaknesses** | Over-frugal, misses opportunities, stressed about spending |\n| **Common Mistakes** | Not investing, keeping money in savings account, missing inflation |\n| **Typical Age Group** | More common in 40+ but some students bhi hote hain |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nSneha (20, Delhi University) ke paas ₹2 lakh bank balance hai but woh FD mein rakhi hai jo 4% deta hai. Inflation 6% hai, toh actually uska paisa ghat raha hai! Woh kisi bhi cheez ke liye paisa kharch nahi karti — na proper books khareedti hai, na friends ke saath jaati hai.\n\n**Improvement Strategy:**\n- Rule of 50-30-20 lagao (Module 3 cross-reference)\n- Minimum 20% paisa invest karo inflation se beat karne ke liye\n- \"Fun budget\" banao — ₹500-1000 monthly jo khushi ke liye kharch karna hai\n\n---",
