        "title": "Money Personality Types — Tumhara Paisa Kaunsa Hai? (Part 2)",
        "content": "#### 2. THE SPENDER (Kharch Khushi Type)\n\n**Score Range:** 16-20 points in Spender category\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Strengths** | Enjoys life, generous, experiences value karta hai |\n| **Weaknesses** | Impulse buying, credit card debt, no emergency fund |\n| **Common Mistakes** | Overspending, peer pressure, lifestyle inflation |\n| **Typical Age Group** | Very common in 18-25 age group |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nKunal (21, Mumbai College) ki salary/internship ki ₹15,000 hai but woh ₹25,000 kharch karta hai. Credit card se gap fill karta hai. Har month minimum due deta hai jo 36% interest charge karta hai. Uska ₹50,000 credit card debt ho gaya hai.\n\n**Calculation:**\n| Month | Starting Debt | Interest (3% monthly) | Minimum Due (5%) | Ending Debt |\n|-------|--------------|----------------------|-------------------|-------------|\n| 1 | ₹50,000 | ₹1,500 | ₹2,500 | ₹49,000 |\n| 2 | ₹49,000 | ₹1,470 | ₹2,450 | ₹48,020 |\n| 3 | ₹48,020 | ₹1,440 | ₹2,401 | ₹47,059 |\n\n**Improvement Strategy:**\n- 24-hour rule lagao ₹500 se zyada ke purchases ke liye\n- Cash envelope system use karo (Module 3 cross-reference)\n- Social media unfollow karo jo spending trigger karta hai\n\n---\n\n#### 3. THE INVESTOR (Paisa Badhao Type)\n\n**Score Range:** 16-20 points in Investor category\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Strengths** | Wealth builder, financially aware, future-oriented |\n| **Weaknesses** | Over-obsessed with returns, may miss present joys |\n| **Common Mistakes** | Over-trading, ignoring risk, analysis paralysis |\n| **Typical Age Group** | Mix of young enthusiasts and experienced investors |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nAmit (22, IIT Delhi) ko investing bahut pasand hai. Woh daily stock prices dekhta hai, 10 different apps use karta hai, but actual returns average se kam hain kyunki woh baar-baar buy-sell karta hai. Kabhi kabhi emotional hoke loss pe bech deta hai.\n\n**Improvement Strategy:**\n- SIP set karo, baar-baar mat chuo (Module 7 cross-reference)\n- Portfolio quarterly dekho, daily nahi\n- Long-term mindset develop karo — \"Time in market > Timing the market\"\n\n---\n\n#### 4. THE GIVER (Daanveer Type)",
