        "content": "**Score Range:** 16-20 points in Giver category\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Strengths** | Generous, caring, relationships strong |\n| **Weaknesses** | Over-generous, ignores own financial health |\n| **Common Mistakes** | Lending money without limits, not saying no |\n| **Typical Age Group** | Common in all age groups |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nPriya (20, Bangalore College) apne sab friends ko borrow karne deti hai. ₹5,000 idhar, ₹2,000 udhar. Kabhi wapas nahi aata. Uske khud ke paas emergency fund nahi hai. Jab usko paise chahiye hote hain, toh koi return nahi karta.\n\n**Improvement Strategy:**\n- \"Lending limit\" set karo — max ₹2,000 ek baar mein\n- Rule banao: \"Jo main de doon, woh gift samjho\"\n- Pehle apna financial health secure karo, phir doosron ki help karo\n\n---\n\n#### 5. THE AVOIDER (Andha Type)\n\n**Score Range:** 16-20 points in Avoider category\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Strengths** | Stress-free in short term |\n| **Weaknesses** | Financial ignorance, major problems later |\n| **Common Mistakes** | No budget, no savings, no investment, no insurance |\n| **Typical Age Group** | Common in students who never handled money |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nMeera (19, Pune College) ko pata hai ki usko save karna chahiye but woh sochti hai \"abhi toh chota hoon, baad mein dekhungi.\" Bank balance dekhne se darti hai. Credit card bill nahi dekhti, auto-debit pe chhod diya hai — but account mein balance nahi hai toh penalty aa rahi hai.\n\n**Improvement Strategy:**\n- Baby steps lo — pehle ₹100/month save karo\n- Financial journal maintain karo (Module 12.5 mein details)\n- Ek trusted friend ya senior se baat karo paise ke baare mein\n- \"Financial date\" fix karo — month mein ek baar 30 minute paise ke baare mein socho\n\n### Money Personality Compatibility in Relationships\n\n| Combination | Compatibility | Challenge |\n|-------------|---------------|-----------|\n| Saver + Spender | Medium | Balance banana padega |\n| Saver + Saver | High | Dono conservative ho sakte hain |\n| Spender + Spender | Low | Financial disaster! |\n| Investor + Saver | High | Good combination |\n| Giver + Spender | Low | Dono ko limits chahiye |\n| Avoider + Anyone | Low | Avoider ko pehle change karo |\n\n---",
