        "title": "Emotional Spending Triggers — Kab Kharch Kar Dete Ho Bina Soche",
        "content": "Yaar, hum sab ke saath hota hai — kuch cheezein hain jo humein trigger karti hain aur hum bina soche kharch kar dete hain. Chalo in triggers ko samjhte hain.\n\n### 10 Common Emotional Spending Triggers\n\n#### 1. Stress Spending (Retail Therapy)\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Trigger** | Exam pressure, fight with friends, family problems |\n| **Warning Signs** | \"Mujhe kuch khareedna hai, mood theek hoga\" |\n| **Common Purchases** | Food, clothes, online shopping |\n| **Prevention Strategy** | 10-minute walk, deep breathing, call a friend |\n| **Alternative Action** | Journal likho, music suno, exercise karo |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nPriya ki exam thi, usne stress mein ₹2,000 ka chocolate box khareed liya. \"Exam ke baad celebrate karungi.\" Exam kharab gaya, ab chocolates bhi khaye nahi ja rahe aur ₹2,000 bhi gaye.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Boredom Spending (Raat Ki Shopping)\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Trigger** | Free time, scrolling social media, late night |\n| **Warning Signs** | \"Kuch dekhte hain... add to cart\" |\n| **Common Purchases** | Online shopping, food delivery, subscriptions |\n| **Prevention Strategy** | Shopping apps hatao, screen time limit lagao |\n| **Alternative Action** | Book padho, exercise karo, sleep early |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nKunal raat 2 baje Instagram scroll kar raha tha. Ek ad dekha — \"50% OFF ending tonight!\" Usne ₹3,000 ka headphones khareed liye. Subah uth ke samajh aaya ki use headphones ki zaroorat nahi thi.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. Social Pressure Spending (Doston Ke Saath)\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Trigger** | Friends ke saath outing, group decisions |\n| **Warning Signs** | \"Sab khareed rahe hain, main alag kyun?\" |\n| **Common Purchases** | Restaurants, movies, party, group trips |\n| **Prevention Strategy** | Budget set karo, \"no\" bolna seekho |\n| **Alternative Action** | Free activities suggest karo, potluck karo |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nAman ke dost ne bola \"Mall chalte hain!\" Aman ke paas budget nahi tha but usne socha \"log kya kahenge.\" ₹5,000 kharch kiye — pizza, movie, shopping. Baad mein 15 din Maggie khana pada.\n\n---\n\n#### 4. Celebration Spending (Party After Exam)\n\n| Aspect | Details |\n|--------|---------|\n| **Trigger** | Exam khatam, birthday, promotion, achievement |\n| **Warning Signs** | \"Mehnat ki hai, reward chahiye!\" |\n| **Common Purchases** | Expensive dinner, gifts, party |\n| **Prevention Strategy** | Pre-decide celebration budget |\n| **Alternative Action** | Free celebration — park, home cooking, friends |",
        "color": "#2563eb",
        "emoji": "🧘",
        "interactiveType": "none"
