        "title": "Financial Anxiety Aur Mental Health — Paisa Aur Dimag Ka Rishta",
        "content": "Yaar, paise aur mental health ka rishta bahut gehra hai. India mein iske baare mein khula ke baat nahi hoti, but yeh bahut important hai.\n\n### Types of Financial Anxiety\n\n#### 1. Money OCD (Obsessive Checking)\n\n| Symptom | Frequency | Impact |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| Bank balance check karna | 50+ times/day | Time waste, stress |\n| UPI transaction check karna | Every 5 minutes | Anxiety |\n| Credit card statement check | Daily | Obsessive behavior |\n| Bill payment worry | Even after paying | Mental exhaustion |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nAman har 10 minute mein bank balance check karta hai. UPI notification aata hai — turant check karta hai. Raat ko 3 baar uthta hai balance dekhne ke liye. Phone ka battery bhi khatam hota hai aur woh bhi.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Financial Paralysis (Decision Freeze)\n\n| Symptom | Frequency | Impact |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| Investment nahi kar paana | Always | Opportunity loss |\n| Budget decide nahi ho paana | Always | No financial plan |\n| Bill pay karne mein delay | Often | Late fees |\n| Purchase postpone karna | Always | Living below potential |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nSneha ko pata hai ki use mutual funds mein invest karna chahiye. But woh sochti hai \"kaunsa loons? galat toh nahi hoga?\" 2 saal se soch rahi hai, ab tak kuch nahi kiya. Inflation uska paisa kha raha hai.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. Comparison Anxiety (Social Media Wala Dard)\n\n| Symptom | Frequency | Impact |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| Instagram pe logon ke lifestyle dekh ke feel karna | Daily | Self-esteem loss |\n| \"Mere saath kyun nahi ho raha\" | Often | Depression |\n| Friends ke spending dekh ke jealousy | Often | Resentment |\n| Apne aap ko kamzor samajhna | Always | Confidence loss |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nMeera Instagram pe dekhti hai ki uski classmate luxury hotels mein hai, branded kapde pehnti hai. Usko lagta hai \"main itni mehnat karti hoon but mere paas kuch nahi.\" Reality: woh classmate credit card pe rehti hai, Meera actually better hai financially.\n\n---\n\n#### 4. Future Anxiety (Retirement Ka Darr)",
