        "title": "Financial Anxiety Aur Mental Health — Paisa Aur Dimag Ka Rishta (Part 2)",
        "content": "| Symptom | Frequency | Impact |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| \"Kya hoga retired hokar?\" | Daily | Chronic worry |\n| \"Kya mera bachcha padh payega?\" | Often | Anxiety |\n| \"Kya mujhe medical bills afford honge?\" | Often | Sleep issues |\n| \"Kya main gareeb ho jaunga?\" | Sometimes | Panic attacks |\n\n**Indian Example:**\nAmit (22) ko retirement ki tension hai. \"40 saal baad kya hoga?\" Daily sochta hai. Actually abhi usko 40 saal hain! But yeh anxiety uski daily productivity affect kar rahi hai.\n\n---\n\n### Symptoms Checklist\n\n**Physical Symptoms:**\n\n| Symptom | Mild | Moderate | Severe |\n|---------|------|----------|--------|\n| Sleep issues (paise ke thoughts) | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Headache (financial stress) | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Stomach problems | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Chest tightness | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Fatigue | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n\n**Emotional Symptoms:**\n\n| Symptom | Mild | Moderate | Severe |\n|---------|------|----------|--------|\n| Constant worry about money | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Irritability when spending | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Guilt after purchases | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Shame about financial situation | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Helplessness about money | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n\n**Behavioral Symptoms:**\n\n| Symptom | Mild | Moderate | Severe |\n|---------|------|----------|--------|\n| Avoiding financial discussions | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Obsessive budgeting | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Emotional eating/shopping | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Isolation from friends | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n| Neglecting responsibilities | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ |\n\n### When to Seek Professional Help\n\n| Severity | Signs | Action |\n|----------|-------|--------|\n| Mild | Occasional worry, manageable | Self-help strategies |\n| Moderate | Daily worry, affecting work | Therapist/Counselor |\n| Severe | Panic attacks, suicidal thoughts | Immediate professional help |\n\n### Self-Help Strategies\n\n#### 1. Financial Journaling (Paisa Diary)\n\n**How to do it:**\n- Daily 10 minutes likho\n- Har purchase ke reasons likho\n- Emotions track karo\n- Weekly review karo",
