        "title": "Financial Anxiety Aur Mental Health — Paisa Aur Dimag Ka Rishta (Part 3)",
        "content": "**Template:**\n```\nDate: ___________\nAmount spent: ₹___________\nWhat: ___________\nWhy: ___________\nEmotion: ___________\nNeed or Want: ___________\nRegret level (1-10): ___________\n```\n\n#### 2. Mindful Spending Meditation\n\n**Steps:**\n1. 5 minute baith jao\n2. Deep breaths lo\n3. Socho paise ke baare mein\n4. Judge mat karo, sirf observe karo\n5. Gratitude feel karo jo hai uske liye\n\n#### 3. Worry Time Scheduling\n\n**How it works:**\n- Har din 15 minute ka \"worry time\" fix karo\n- Sirf uss time pe paise ke baare mein socho\n- Baaki time jab worry aaye, bolo \"worry time pe sochunga\"\n- Gradually worry time kam karo\n\n#### 4. Gratitude Practice\n\n**Daily routine:**\n| Time | Activity | Duration |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| Morning | 3 cheezein likho jo hain | 2 min |\n| Afternoon | Ek acchi financial cheez note karo | 1 min |\n| Evening | Family/friends ki financial help yaad karo | 2 min |\n\n### Indian Stigma Around Mental Health and Money\n\n**Common Myths vs Reality:**\n\n| Myth | Reality |\n|------|---------|\n| \"Paisa hai toh kyun tension?\" | Paisa hone ke baavjud bhi anxiety hoti hai |\n| \"Mental health luxury hai\" | Mental health basic need hai |\n| \"Therapist ke paas jaana pagalpan hai\" | Therapist ke paas jaana brave hai |\n| \"Paise ki baat family se nahi karte\" | Open discussion se problems solve hoti hain |\n| \"Aur paisa aayega toh sab theek\" | Relationship with money matters more than amount |\n\n### Resources for Help\n\n| Resource | Type | Contact |\n|----------|------|---------|\n| iCall | Phone counseling | 9152987821 |\n| Vandrevala Foundation | 24/7 helpline | 1860-2662-345 |\n| NIMHANS | Mental health institute | 080-46110007 |\n| PRATEE | Financial therapy | prateelife.com |\n| BetterHelp | Online therapy | BetterHelp app |\n\n---",
