        "cardIndex": 3,
        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Social Media Aur Comparison Culture — Digital Duniya Ka Money Trap (Part 3)",
        "content": "### Digital Detox Challenge for Wallet Health\n\n**7-Day Challenge:**\n\n| Day | Task | Expected Savings |\n|-----|------|-----------------|\n| Day 1 | Delete shopping apps | ₹500-1,000 |\n| Day 2 | Unfollow 20 sale pages | ₹300-500 |\n| Day 3 | Turn off all notifications | ₹200-400 |\n| Day 4 | No social media for 2 hours | ₹500-1,000 |\n| Day 5 | Follow 5 finance accounts | Knowledge gain |\n| Day 6 | Track all spending | Awareness gain |\n| Day 7 | Review week's savings | ₹2,000-4,000 |\n\n**Expected Result:** ₹2,000-4,000 savings in one week!\n\n### FOMO vs JOMO (Joy of Missing Out)\n\n| FOMO (Fear of Missing Out) | JOMO (Joy of Missing Out) |\n|---------------------------|---------------------------|\n| \"Sab khareed rahe hain, main miss kar raha hoon\" | \"Main save kar raha hoon, accha lag raha hai\" |\n| \"Sale miss ho jaayegi\" | \"Sale toh aati rahegi\" |\n| \"Friends party ke liye bula rahe hain\" | \"Main apne goal ke liye kar raha hoon\" |\n| \"Sab travel kar rahe hain\" | \"Main invest kar raha hoon future ke liye\" |\n\n**How to Shift from FOMO to JOMO:**\n1. Gratitude practice karo\n2. Long-term goals yaad karo\n3. Financial progress track karo\n4. \"No\" bolna seekho\n5. JOMO community banao\n\n---",
